# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:128
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_172c8f4d:

    # "It was clearly a section of the fort fully devoted to supporting our physical well-being."
    "明らかに、ここは我々の身体的な健康を支えるために捧げられた要塞の一角であった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:130
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_e5bd48af:

    # RECRUIT "Ow! What are you~"
    RECRUIT "いたっ! 何なの〜？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:131
translate ja qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_3fa31f5f:

    # "Over at the corner of the room, a nurse and a physician were likely putting that recruit's face back together."
